<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 400 MLN OF 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 400 MLN OF 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 400 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills, the</p>
<p>central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - Feb 26, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - May 28, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
